{
  "key": 8340,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_1079_C07R0501_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "You there.\n",
        "Watch this Coin.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1079_C07R0501_00001",
      "en_US": "Spin, spin, spin, spin, spin...\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1079_C07R0501_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Now, which hand is that Coin in?\n",
        "My left or right?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1079_C07R0501_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Boo!\n",
        "Poor show!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1079_C07R0501_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Bravo!\n",
        "A winner is you!\r",
        "For our winner, I have here...\n",
        "A Coin Case!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1079_C07R0501_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Me, I am but a tearful clown.\n",
        "Though I smile, I cry inside."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1079_C07R0501_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "There are many magicians in the world.\n",
        "You know, the performance artists?\r",
        "Don’t you think, that maybe, say,\n",
        "five percent are actually psychics?"
      ]
    }
  ]
}